# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Added here: Retrieval for Mauren (1078).
# Left out: Daily Delivery (469).
# Givers passed at Menethil and left for the 27-29 Wetlands visit (06-wetlands), by design: Reclaiming
# Goods and Apprentice's Duties (281, 471): their work is the hovels and north-coast loop that visit
# makes anyway for The Cursed Crew, so taking them at 24 would add a trip; Uncovering the Past (299,
# level 27, 2.6-3.3 over at the dig), The Third Fleet, From the Ashes and Raene's Cleansing (288,
# 98221, 1026: levels 27-28).
# Hand-cut 2026-11-07 (the Alliance 21-24 level hole): the 20-24 part of the old 25-29 guide,
# played right after Darkshore; the 27-29 Wetlands, Ironforge and Stormwind quests are in
# 06-wetlands, after Duskwood. Ashenvale runs by quest level: Astranaar, Lake Falathim and
# Stonetalon (19-22) first, then the east loop and Ilkrud and the Zoram Strand (24-25).
# Group quest: Gerenzo's Orders (1090, `when group 1090`, #1370): Piznik's five-minute defence in the Windshear
# Mine (quest level 22) was lost solo at 23 and 25 in players' recordings; grouped players finished it from 23.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Darkshore

step Kerlonian Evershade
  zone Darkshore
  tip Back north from the glaive (Druids: south along the road from Auberdine) to the Grove of the Ancients, where Kerlonian sleeps beside Arbal. Take his quest, open his chest for the Horn of Awakening, use it to wake him and lead him south along the road to his bag at the southern edge of Darkshore; blow the horn again whenever he falls asleep. Then go on to Liladris Moonriver at Maestra's Post.
  tip Careful: Scripted ambushes of three mobs each attack along the road.
  accept 5321                                 -- Kerlonian Evershade
  collect 13536 quest 5321.1                  -- Kerlonian's Chest, beside him
  goto 44.4,76.4 "Kerlonian Evershade"
  note Escort Kerlonian south along the road to his bag at the southern edge of Darkshore, then go on to Liladris at Maestra's Post.

step Ashenvale
  zone Ashenvale
  goto 26.2,38.7 "Maestra's Post"

