# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Stonetalon Mountains

step Stonetalon Mountains
  zone Stonetalon Mountains
  tip Head south past Mystral Lake into the Talondeep Path tunnel; it comes out in Stonetalon's Windshear Crag, north of the Windshear Mine.
  goto 76.5,45.5 "Windshear Crag"

step Piznik
  when group 1090
  tip Piznik's defence is hard alone at this level: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Skip it if you are alone.
  tip Piznik mines at the bottom of the Windshear Mine at the east end of the crag, past its kobolds (levels 19-23). Talk to him, then keep him alive for five minutes while he mines: a dozen or more kobolds come at him in waves, melee fighters first, then casters, and the mine's own kobolds respawn into the fight. If he dies, the quest fails.
  accept 1090                         -- Below ground
  complete 1090 @71.87,60.0           -- Keep Piznik alive while he mines, below ground
  turnin 1090
  accept 1092

step Windshear Crag
  zone Stonetalon Mountains
  tip Kaela and Gaxim camp on the Webwinder Path, south-west of the mine.
  turnin 1070                             -- Kaela Shadowspear
  accept 1085
  turnin 1085                             -- Gaxim Rustfizzle
  accept 1071

