step The Foulweald
  tip The Foulweald furbolgs live in the woods south of the road, south-east of Astranaar. The Den Watcher and the Ursas guard the den.
  kill 3746 quest 1025                    -- Foulweald Den Watcher
  kill 3749 quest 1025                    -- Foulweald Ursa
