step Shael'dryn
  tip Follow the road east to the Howling Vale; Shael'dryn stands by the moonwell.
  turnin 1024

step Dal Bloodclaw
  tip Dal Bloodclaw (25) leads the Thistlefur furbolgs at the camp north of Astranaar. Clear his guards first, one at a time.
  tip Careful: The furbolgs near him usually join in when he is pulled. Killing the ones along his path first lets you fight him alone.
  collect 5544 quest 1054                 -- Dal Bloodclaw's Skull

