  tip Off the boat, walk up the pier: Karl Boran on the pier, James Halloran by the docks to the north, Valstag Ironjaw in the keep, the inn (First Mate Fitzsimmons) east of it with Caitlin Grassman and Sida beside it, Tarrel Rockweaver by the north gate on the way out east.
