# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Ironforge

step Fly to Ironforge
  zone Wetlands
  tip Shellei Brondir is the flight master by Menethil's inn: you have both flight paths since your first trip east.
  goto 9.5,59.7 "Menethil Harbor flight master"
  fly "Ironforge"
  zone Ironforge

step Ironforge
  zone Ironforge
  tip The gryphons land in the Great Forge. Lomac Gearstrip stands in Tinker Town, east of it, by the Deeprun Tram.
  turnin 1072                             -- Lomac Gearstrip, Tinker Town
  turnin 968 optional                     -- Only with Book: The Powers Below from Darkshore: Gerrig Bonegrip, the Forlorn Cavern
  train class only Warrior,Paladin,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Warlock
  vendor nearest

step Buliwyf Stonehand
  only Warrior
  zone Ironforge
  when money>=10s
  when !skill "Two-Handed Axes" 1
  tip While you're here: learn Two-Handed Axes from Buliwyf Stonehand (Military Ward, 10 silver); two-handers level a Warrior fastest.
  train 11865                         -- Buliwyf Stonehand

step Buliwyf Stonehand
  only Warrior
  zone Ironforge
